# live directory listings: all four core components (make/base/gui/back) live
# under pub/gnustep/core/, and GWorkspace is an application tarball under
# pub/gnustep/usr-apps/. There are NO per-category gui/ back/ apps/ dirs (they
# 404); the earlier note claiming otherwise was wrong and is corrected here.
